    rdf:value """Saturday, Apr. 20, 1907
London.
Dressmaker’s. Alys and I lunched together.
I went to Richmond and dined with Michael alone, as Field was ill.
Karin seemed discouragingly deaf . It is too awful. She got up for the first time."""^^xsd:string ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:index 132 ;
